# Never send local state or secrets to an image build: .local holds database credentials, the development JWT secret and evidence.
.local
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
.git
# rebuilt inside the image
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# large, not needed to build the platform
media
releases
tests/evidence
ml/datasets/generated
**/*.mp4
# …except the website's own film renditions: the image's build step runs the whole build, and the website build refuses to
# pre-render a film whose renditions are missing (found on 17 Nov 2026 by building in this context: the image could not be built)
!apps/website/media/**/*.mp4
